{"id":"poskoree","lemma":"поскорее","pos":"adv","rank":2081,"glosses":["quick!; hurry!; hurry up!"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу поскорее умереть.","en":"I want to die soon.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to die of natural causes"}]},{"text":"Я бы лучше поскорее решил эту проблему.","en":"I'd better solve this problem quickly.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},null,{"g":"to solve, to settle","l":"решить"},null,null]},{"text":"Её единственное желание - поскорее снова его увидеть.","en":"Her only desire is to see him again soon.","words":[{"g":"her"},{"g":"sole, only, unique","l":"единственный"},{"g":"wish, desire"},null,{"g":"anew"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Я просто хочу поскорее убраться отсюда.","en":"I just want to get out of here as quickly as I can.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to clean up"},{"g":"from here, hence"}]},{"text":"Давай закончим поскорее.","en":"Let's finish up in a hurry.","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to finish, to end","l":"закончить"},null]}]}